    <h2>What this artifact cannot show</h2>
    <p>The other half of the change &mdash; one trigger subscribing to several connector
       events via checkboxes instead of a single-select &mdash; <strong>is not demonstrable
       in this organization</strong>. The connection picker lists 26 connections, of which
       zero are Slack and zero are GitHub, and those are the only two connectors that
       declare <code>behaviorEvents</code>. With no multi-event catalog to render, the
       control stays a single row.</p>
    <p>That half therefore rests on unit and mutation evidence below, not on a screenshot.
       Stated plainly rather than papered over with a seeded fixture.</p>
  </div>

