    <h2>The contract did not change</h2>
    <p><code>triggers</code> is still
       <code>Type.Array(BehaviorTriggerSchema, {{ minItems: 0, maxItems: 16 }})</code>.
       No migration, no SDK break, no MCP schema edit, and the runtime still ORs across the
       array. An author who needs two activations across different connections, or with
       different run semantics, still has that through the API &mdash; those axes are real
       and are why the array stays.</p>
    <p>What changed is only which of those shapes the <em>form</em> will author. The diff is
       five files, all under
       <code>src/components/agents/behaviors/</code> and
       <code>src/components/behaviors/</code>.</p>
  </div>

  <footer>
    <p>Captured against the real production API through the Vite
       <code>LOBU_API_PROXY</code> hook, so the screenshots show live data on the branch
       bundle. That proves the branch UI, not a deployed one.</p>
    <p>The pointer bump in lobu#2515 advances <code>packages/owletto</code> past unrelated
